===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʃɪptʋɛt/|lang=no}}

===Etymology===
It is believed that the first part of the name (''Ski-'') comes from ''[[skagi]]'', Old Norse meaning "raised object", while the last part comes from the word ''[[ptveit]]'', a common [[Viking]] age farm name.

